# Every docked screen at Lave that is still the original's, from the start of a game: the status screen it opens on,
# then F3 to F5, F7, Esc and F6, the docked host's keys (D96). Both charts move their cursor; the equipment screen buys a
# missile. F2 opens the market, D01, which its known answers and its golden image test instead.
